{"blobPool":{"0e6d09c9fd75c81b1c8df876dddc608ca7dbbebfba6d692a423c148d61175dc3":{"role":"user","text":"Begin your mission: # Scenario: Dock and Sell\n\nYou are evaluated on your ability to complete a basic mine-and-sell loop without assistance.\n\n## Objective\n\nMine ore from the Home Asteroid Belt and sell it at Benchmark Home Station.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Start: docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system\n- Stay within the home system at all times\n- You have a basic mining ship with a cargo hold\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- **PASS**: Docked at station and sold at least 1 unit of ore\n- **GOOD**: Sold 10+ units of ore across at least 2 ore types\n- **EXCELLENT**: Sold 25+ units of ore and returned a profit of 500+ credits\n"},"6a42c771961361de5ee8a089214d81e27290a3821f3ac83b0aa65e2408b31242":{"role":"user","text":"Continue your mission."},"7ddea1515a296b8f56d4de5c11b35360612b35b1488130592e24e6ea93a7e7fe":{"role":"assistant","text":"tool: game({\"command\":\"undock\",\"args\":{}})"},"4914f61d8866c2d2e1e4bb7a9cfe1fb068e3d009c011df1ebedf7532014b6ae1":{"role":"toolResult","tool":"game","text":"Undocked from station."},"b3f10190716f51570d77c70535d2e6a66152c28cf40effb5c6a17616677785e5":{"role":"assistant","text":"tool: game({\"command\":\"travel\",\"args\":{\"destination\":\"Home Asteroid Belt\"}})"},"3a614ef17835c54c40b98e90465d23190b75bf4ce7f3574daa6669d42f66d0a7":{"role":"toolResult","tool":"game","error":true,"text":"Error: [invalid_payload] Unknown parameter(s): [destination]. Requires 'target_poi'. Example: {\"target_poi\": \"main_belt\"}"},"e3ccbb959b6685deeaf8defb191167683f99a9db212202cc2697da5d9edf4a29":{"role":"assistant","text":"tool: game({\"command\":\"travel\",\"args\":{\"target_poi\":\"main_belt\"}})